[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15600.07, "timestamp": "04:20:00", "text": "感谢上帝。我已经把库存清单发给你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15603.189, "timestamp": "04:20:03", "text": "你吓到我了。我的天啊。生命是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15606.309, "timestamp": "04:20:06", "text": "好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15614.149, "timestamp": "04:20:14", "text": "告诉我这双靴子的魔法咒语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15617.189, "timestamp": "04:20:17", "text": "呃，靴子。好的。呃，靴子真是……哦，我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15621.75, "timestamp": "04:20:21", "text": "上帝。嗯，有弹性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15624.71, "timestamp": "04:20:24", "text": "有弹性的。靴子。哦，等等。等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15627.67, "timestamp": "04:20:27", "text": "所以，呃，哦，等等。我忘了发送我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15632.229, "timestamp": "04:20:32", "text": "d 那个盔甲之类的东西。好的。所以，呃，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15635.03, "timestamp": "04:20:35", "text": "想要那套盔甲吗？你做了什么？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15638.229, "timestamp": "04:20:38", "text": "好的。等等，那把红色的剑是什么？如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15640.87, "timestamp": "04:20:40", "text": "你有没有一把红色的剑？那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15643.99, "timestamp": "04:20:43", "text": "狂战士之剑。使用时，它有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15647.189, "timestamp": "04:20:47", "text": "变红之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15650.149, "timestamp": "04:20:50", "text": "所以，这是一把普通的剑，对吧？呃，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15652.95, "timestamp": "04:20:52", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15656.95, "timestamp": "04:20:56", "text": "金子。"}]